            },
            "author": {
              "@type": "Person",
              "name": "Janet Cordingly Stout"
            },
            "reviewBody": "Very good. I added 1 Granny Smith apple sliced. I did not peel it. I also used pork broth (homemade) instead of beef. After it was cooked in the slow cooker, I made a bed of it in my roasting pan and put a half pork loin on top. My sauerkraut lovers loved it! Will make again. Next time I might try some Polish Sausage in it.",
            "datePublished": "2016-12-27T01:24:47.967Z"
          },
